    "text": "wvlegals.com\nwebsite\nHampshire County, West Virginia\nHampshire County Planning Commission Comprehensive Plan Survey and Public Meeting Information\nBy Hampshire Review,\n15 hours agoHampshire County Planning Commission Comprehensive Plan Survey and Public Meeting Information. The Hampshire County Planning Commission would like the public’s input on goals for the future of Hampshire County. This will be conveyed by the upcoming update to the Hampshire County Comprehensive Plan. We are interested to hear all your questions, comments and concerns. Please plan to attend the public meeting in your area.",
